<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Capital sells Beach stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Capital sells Beach stake.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capital Energy NL said on Friday it has sold its holding in Beach Petroleum NL and would use the proceeds to extinguish the balance of its A$4.8 million debt facility about five years ahead of schedule.</p>
<p>Capital Energy had said previously it held about 12.5 percent of Beach Petroleum's ordinary shares. Beach shares were trading unchanged at 15.5 cents at 2.40 p.m. 0340 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
